Cell["\<\
The returned association preserves displacement keys. Each matrix has rows \
belonging to that cell and columns belonging to the reference cell.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->824449078,ExpressionUUID->"48ceba14-f93f-7e48-9ed3-3d398ab90add"],

